{"seq":2,"slug":"directory-structures","title":"目录组织：线性、B 树与哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/file-systems-design/data-structures/directory-structures","wordCount":1581,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"目录组织-线性-b-树与哈希\">目录组织：线性、B 树与哈希</h1><p>一个目录在 <a href=\"../foundations/filesystem-concepts\">文件系统抽象</a> 里被定义为&quot;名字到 inode 号的映射&quot;,但映射有很多种存法。把它存成一个数组,还是一棵树,还是一张哈希表,这个选择在小目录上毫无差别,在塞了百万个文件的目录上却决定了 <code>ls</code>、<code>open</code>、<code>create</code> 是几毫秒还是几十秒。这一篇比较三种主流目录组织方式各自的查找、插入与遍历代价,以及为什么现代文件系统在线性结构之外又长出了树和哈希。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>目录的核心操作有四个,任何组织方式都要支持,而它们的代价决定了适用场景:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  DIR[&quot;目录组织&quot;] --&gt; OP1[&quot;lookup 按名查 inode&quot;]&#10;  DIR --&gt; OP2[&quot;insert 新增条目&quot;]&#10;  DIR --&gt; OP3[&quot;delete 删除条目&quot;]&#10;  DIR --&gt; OP4[&quot;readdir 顺序遍历&quot;]&#10;  OP1 --&gt; CASE[&quot;open/路径解析最频繁&quot;]&#10;  OP4 --&gt; CASE2[&quot;ls/备份依赖它&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  DIR[\"目录组织\"] --&gt; OP1[\"lookup 按名查 inode\"]\n  DIR --&gt; OP2[\"insert 新增条目\"]\n  DIR --&gt; OP3[\"delete 删除条目\"]\n  DIR --&gt; OP4[\"readdir 顺序遍历\"]\n  OP1 --&gt; CASE[\"open/路径解析最频繁\"]\n  OP4 --&gt; CASE2[\"ls/备份依赖它\"]</pre><p>三种组织方式在这四个操作上的代价对比(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为目录内条目数):</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组织方式</th>\n<th>lookup</th>\n<th>insert</th>\n<th>delete</th>\n<th>readdir</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性数组</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 追加</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 天然有序</td>\n<td>ext2、FAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 均摊</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>顺序被打乱</td>\n<td>ext4 HTree</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B/B+ 树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 有序</td>\n<td>XFS、Btrfs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可以看到没有一种全面最优:线性遍历友好但查找慢,哈希查找快但遍历乱,B 树两者均衡但实现复杂。选择取决于目标负载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线性目录-朴素到极致\">线性目录：朴素到极致</h2><p>最早也最简单的目录,就是把条目一条接一条排在目录文件里,每条含名字长度、inode 号和名字本身(变长)。ext2 的目录项 <code>ext2_dir_entry</code> 就是这样。新建文件时找一个够大的空隙塞进去(或追加到末尾),查找则从头线性扫描比对名字。</p>\n<p>这种结构在小目录上完全够用,而且有一个被低估的优点:<strong>readdir 天然按存储顺序返回</strong>,备份工具和 <code>ls</code> 不需要额外排序。删除时通常不真正移动后续条目,而是把被删项的空间并入前一项的长度字段(留下&quot;空洞&quot;),所以目录文件会随增删而内部碎片化。</p>\n<p>它的死穴是查找。当一个目录有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个条目,每次 lookup 平均扫描 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 项。Maildir 邮件目录、构建产物目录、对象存储后端这些动辄百万文件的场景里,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查找会让整个系统陷入 I/O 风暴。这正是更高级结构出现的直接动因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哈希目录-ext4-的-htree\">哈希目录：ext4 的 HTree</h2><p>ext4 在保持向后兼容的前提下解决线性查找问题,办法是 <strong>HTree</strong>(哈希树):对文件名算一个哈希值,用哈希值作为索引在一棵浅树里定位条目所在的块。这棵树通常只有一到两层,所以查找几乎是常数次 I/O。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  NAME[&quot;文件名 report.pdf&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;哈希函数&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; HV[&quot;哈希值&quot;]&#10;  HV --&gt; ROOT[&quot;根索引块&quot;]&#10;  ROOT --&gt; L1[&quot;按哈希区间选中间块&quot;]&#10;  L1 --&gt; LEAF[&quot;叶子块&lt;br/&gt;线性扫几条即命中&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  NAME[\"文件名 report.pdf\"] --&gt; H[\"哈希函数\"]\n  H --&gt; HV[\"哈希值\"]\n  HV --&gt; ROOT[\"根索引块\"]\n  ROOT --&gt; L1[\"按哈希区间选中间块\"]\n  L1 --&gt; LEAF[\"叶子块&lt;br/&gt;线性扫几条即命中\"]</pre><p>HTree 的精妙在于它<strong>伪装成线性目录</strong>:不支持 HTree 的旧内核仍能把它当普通线性目录读,因为索引信息藏在被标记为&quot;空&quot;的目录项里。这让 ext4 能在不破坏磁盘格式的前提下引入加速。</p>\n<p>代价是 readdir 顺序被哈希打乱,返回顺序与名字、创建顺序都无关。这会损害局部性——按 readdir 顺序去 stat 每个文件时,inode 号乱序,引发随机 I/O。ext4 用一个折中:readdir 时把条目按 inode 号排序后再返回,缓解这个问题。哈希也带来理论上的碰撞与&quot;哈希洪水&quot;攻击面,需要带种子的哈希来缓解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"b-树目录-xfs-与-btrfs-的统一武器\">B 树目录：XFS 与 Btrfs 的统一武器</h2><p>XFS 和 Btrfs 走得更彻底:目录就是一棵 B+ 树(或其变体),既支持对数级查找,又保持键有序从而 readdir 高效。Btrfs 尤其激进——它把整个文件系统的所有元数据(inode、目录项、extent 映射)都塞进一棵巨大的 B 树,用不同的 key 类型区分,目录项只是其中一类 key。</p>\n<p>这种统一带来一致的性能:无论目录多大,lookup、insert、delete 都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>,不会像线性目录那样随规模线性退化,也不像哈希那样牺牲遍历顺序。XFS 还为目录维护两套索引——一套按名字哈希(供 lookup),一套按存储偏移(供 readdir),用空间换两类操作都快。</p>\n<p>B 树的代价是实现复杂度和小目录上的额外开销:一个只有三五个文件的目录,用一棵树反而比线性数组多几次间接。所以 XFS 对小目录用&quot;shortform&quot;内联格式直接塞进 inode(呼应 <a href=\"inodes-metadata\">inode 与元数据</a> 里的 inline 思想),只在目录变大时才升级为块格式、再升级为 B 树格式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计取舍与崩溃一致性\">设计取舍与崩溃一致性</h2><p>选哪种结构,本质是在四个操作的代价向量之间挑一个最贴合负载的点。一个经验法则:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>负载特征</th>\n<th>推荐结构</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目录小、文件少</td>\n<td>线性 / inline</td>\n<td>实现简单,无树开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单目录百万文件</td>\n<td>哈希 / B 树</td>\n<td>避免 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频繁全目录遍历</td>\n<td>B 树(有序)</td>\n<td>readdir 有序、局部性好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需向后兼容旧格式</td>\n<td>哈希伪装(HTree)</td>\n<td>不破坏磁盘格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论哪种结构,目录更新都不是单步操作:新建一个文件要同时改父目录(加条目)、分配 inode、改 inode 位图,这几步必须一起成功或一起失败,否则会出现&quot;目录里有名字但 inode 未分配&quot;之类的悬空。这种跨结构的原子性需求,正是 <a href=\"../reliability/journaling\">日志文件系统</a> 把目录项更新纳入事务的原因;而 B 树/HTree 这类复杂结构一旦中途崩溃,修复难度也更高,见 <a href=\"../reliability/consistency-fsck\">一致性与崩溃恢复</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>目录是名字到 inode 号的映射,但存成数组、哈希表还是 B 树,决定了大目录上的性能。</li>\n<li><strong>线性目录</strong>:插入快、readdir 天然有序,但 lookup 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>,百万文件下崩溃。</li>\n<li><strong>哈希目录(HTree)</strong>:lookup 近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>,伪装成线性以兼容旧格式,代价是 readdir 乱序、有碰撞面。</li>\n<li><strong>B/B+ 树目录</strong>:三类操作均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且键有序,readdir 高效;Btrfs 把所有元数据统一进一棵 B 树,小目录则退回 <a href=\"inodes-metadata\">inline</a> 格式。</li>\n<li>选择取决于负载;结构越复杂,崩溃后越难修复,引出 <a href=\"../reliability/journaling\">日志</a> 与 <a href=\"../reliability/consistency-fsck\">崩溃恢复</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"目录组织：线性、B 树与哈希","id":"目录组织-线性-b-树与哈希"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"线性目录：朴素到极致","id":"线性目录-朴素到极致"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希目录：ext4 的 HTree","id":"哈希目录-ext4-的-htree"},{"level":2,"text":"B 树目录：XFS 与 Btrfs 的统一武器","id":"b-树目录-xfs-与-btrfs-的统一武器"},{"level":2,"text":"设计取舍与崩溃一致性","id":"设计取舍与崩溃一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"inode 与元数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/file-systems-design/data-structures/inodes-metadata"},"next":{"title":"空闲空间管理：位图与 extent","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/file-systems-design/data-structures/free-space-management"}}